Depends: python3-minimal, openssh-server, leon-asus-command-access (>= 0.1+leonb53.1+local1)
Description: Preserve ASUS-controlled SSH availability through OpenSSH upgrades
 Records an active managed listener before dpkg and requests its restoration
 after verified OpenSSH replacement. Preserves ASUS enable policy and the
 independent recovery socket without enabling the distribution SSH units.
